---
// Section 4: ONE SAVE, THREE TOOLS — WATCH · SOURCE · DO
---

<section id="action-engine" class="scroll-mt-24 py-24 md:py-32 bg-[#060709] border-b border-white/[0.06] relative">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
    
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center mb-16 space-y-4">
      <div class="inline-block telemetry-pill text-[#FF2D55] bg-[#FF2D55]/10 border-[#FF2D55]/30">
        ONE SAVE · THREE TOOLS
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black text-white tracking-tight leading-tight">
        One save. Three ways to use it.
      </h2>
      <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-[#9CA3AF] max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        STASH keeps the thing you found connected to the thing you actually want to do.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- The 3 Pillars of Every Save -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 text-left">
      
      <!-- Tool 1: WATCH -->
      <div class="specular-box p-7 rounded-3xl space-y-5 flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-white/20 transition-all">
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-[#FF2D55]/10 border border-[#FF2D55]/20 flex items-center justify-center text-[#FF2D55]">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><polygon points="5 3 19 12 5 21 5 3"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-[#FF2D55] font-bold">
            01 · WATCH
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">Official in-app playback</h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#9CA3AF] leading-relaxed">
            Watch inside your vault without feed distraction. Muted by default, smooth scrubbing, zero suggested videos baiting you into an hour of scrolling.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/10 text-[11px] font-mono text-[#8E9196]">
          ✦ No app-hopping to watch
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Tool 2: SOURCE -->
      <div class="specular-box p-7 rounded-3xl space-y-5 flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-white/20 transition-all">
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-[#10B981]/10 border border-[#10B981]/20 flex items-center justify-center text-[#10B981]">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/><line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13"/><line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"/><polyline points="10 9 9 9 8 9"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-[#10B981] font-bold">
            02 · SOURCE NOTES
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">Creator text preserved</h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#9CA3AF] leading-relaxed">
            The creator's ingredients, gear lists, and timestamps preserved verbatim with a 1-tap copy button. No AI summaries rewriting their words.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/10 text-[11px] font-mono text-[#10B981]">
          ✦ 1-Tap Copy to clipboard
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Tool 3: DO -->
      <div class="specular-box p-7 rounded-3xl space-y-5 flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-white/20 transition-all">
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-amber-500/10 border border-amber-500/20 flex items-center justify-center text-amber-500">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="9 11 12 14 22 4"/><path d="M21 12v7a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h11"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-amber-500 font-bold">
            03 · DO
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">Real-world action modes</h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#9CA3AF] leading-relaxed">
            Cook Mode keeps your phone screen awake while prep steps stay readable. Train Mode runs interval rest timers right between gym sets.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/10 text-[11px] font-mono text-amber-400">
          ✦ Screen wake lock & interactive checks
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
